<programme start="20261029113000 +0000" stop="20261029120000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School, Iruma-kun!</title><sub-title lang="en">Party Eve</sub-title><desc lang="en">During the festival, Iruma asks his friends to help him win the grand prize; Asmode is moved by his request and agrees to help; Kiriyo watches her juniors.</desc><credits><actor>Lee Kyung-tae</actor><actor>Min Eung-sik</actor><actor>Kim Myungjun</actor><actor>Kang Eun-ae</actor><actor>Yoon Yong-sik</actor><actor>Lee Saebyeok</actor></credits><date>20210929</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.15.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E16</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/eb4114f35ecaaa450b782f76d2ca657f.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029120000 +0000" stop="20261029123000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Run, Iruma, to Kiriwo!</sub-title><desc lang="en">Babyls is suddenly surrounded by invisible walls, and no one can communicate with the outside, so the teachers have the students take shelter in the central plaza.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20200125</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.16.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E17</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/b6b227ccdc357c7df4ef5008ce896f84.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029123000 +0000" stop="20261029130000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">What I Want More Than Anything</sub-title><desc lang="en">The plan to destroy the school continues to move forward, and Iruma somehow makes it to the hidden room.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20200201</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.17.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E18</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/d59bfae9b706eb22c95ff4d244b1022f.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029130000 +0000" stop="20261029133000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">I Want to Pick Everything Up</sub-title><desc lang="en">The ordeal at Babyls comes to an end, and the Battler Party is finally about to start; the students all do their best in order to get the Grand Prize, and their families come by to enjoy the festivities.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20200208</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.18.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E19</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/8476d63dab2abdbb886ae2e693f0398e.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029133000 +0000" stop="20261029140000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Glorious Award; Treatment of Humans</sub-title><desc lang="en">The ceremonies to give out the prizes for the Battler Party begin; because of the incident with the fireworks, Iruma has caught the attention of the head of the Demon Border Patrol, Azazel Henri.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20200215</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.19.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E20</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/b9832e775593d2f290084c556776859e.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029140000 +0000" stop="20261029143000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Dem-dol Kuromu-chan!</sub-title><desc lang="en">One of the most popular idols in the netherworld is holding an all-day concert, and Iruma happens to get tickets.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20200222</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.20.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E21</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/93ef698e9f7bc9961eff93f356c56027.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029143000 +0000" stop="20261029150000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Sparkling Shock</sub-title><desc lang="en">In order to make the concert at Makubari Dome a success, Iruma and his friends do something rather surprising.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20200229</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.21.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E22</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/3c6c0da3f64ff1458f30e245aeb06aea.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029150000 +0000" stop="20261029153000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">You Fit Right In Now, Iruma-kun</sub-title><desc lang="en">As Iruma continues having fun with his classmates, he begins to wonder if he should really be allowed to stay in the netherworld.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20200307</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.22.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E23</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/78c5ea3b25e357dd46ac57e532ef9662.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029153000 +0000" stop="20261029160000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">The Secret Behind the Ring</sub-title><desc lang="en">Suzuki Iruma ends up in the netherworld using the Gluttonous Feeder Ring to get by in school until the ring started to speak.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20210417</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.0.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E01</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/acfa1e1bb3972054ea26633ad8e743b5.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029160000 +0000" stop="20261029163000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Ameri&apos;s Decision</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Magical Apparatus Battler is put on hiatus due to Kiriwo&apos;s absence; Ameri agrees to let them reinstate the Battler, but first, the three members must experience other Battlers.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20210424</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.1.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E02</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/0afab4f153ec7247e6bc83d0f5fd8ef9.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029163000 +0000" stop="20261029170000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">A Lovely Demoness</sub-title><desc lang="en">Amid confusion, Ronove Romiere, the president of the Disciplinary Battler, comes to try to steal Ameri&apos;s position; he proposes a dissolution election against the student council.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20210501</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.2.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E03</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/57d665bd0d412739105a823d00595664.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029170000 +0000" stop="20261029173000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">The Student Council President&apos;s Gaze</sub-title><desc lang="en">Ronove declares that he&apos;s going to take the position of student council president by holding a dissolution election but due to a spell that someone has cast, Ameri is unable to be her usual confident self and is very meek.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20240107</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.3.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E04</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1280x720/1ab192a046e806c596b4cdb0d6a883c6.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029173000 +0000" stop="20261029180000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Invite Your Friends!</sub-title><desc lang="en">After finishing his time with the student council, Iruma finally goes back home; Sullivan is ecstatic that Iruma came home and throws him a welcome home party.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20210516</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.4.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E05</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/ddcb3a2970e17343587e835b1b717354.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029180000 +0000" stop="20261029183000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Royal One</sub-title><desc lang="en">Ali-san pressures Iruma to go through his evil cycle; Iruma&apos;s classmates praise him on how much more confident he has become; Iruma proposes something to Kalego once he realizes how horrific the Misfit Class&apos; classroom truly is.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20210522</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.5.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E06</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/44fc40128cbe2aec6b801c26961b0e8c.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029183000 +0000" stop="20261029190000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">The Teachers at Babyls</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Misfit Class must gather approved permission slips from all the faculty members within three days to move to the Royal One.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20240114</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.6.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E07</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/0bcb91336d638f7fcfb776daa7f8d0f1.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029190000 +0000" stop="20261029193000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">The Miracle of Some Fools</sub-title><desc lang="en">Iruma confronts Kalego with the teachers&apos; consent forms but Kalego claims Iruma is unworthy to inherit Derkila&apos;s classroom.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20240114</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.7.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E08</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/c53a5c01bdcd6d2b29233e615d3f399c.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029193000 +0000" stop="20261029200000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Studying in the Netherworld</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Misfit Class is super excited for summer vacation, but then they&apos;re reminded that if they don&apos;t do well on the end of terminus exams, they&apos;ll have to stay for supplementary classes during their break.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20210612</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.8.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E09</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/d5b328d604f27ec6b9460cb37733831f.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029200000 +0000" stop="20261029203000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Balam&apos;s Lesson</sub-title><desc lang="en">The instructor for the study of imaginary beasts, Balam Shichiro, can&apos;t help but touch any living creature he comes in contact with.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20210619</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.9.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E10</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/baaec9dc254a92c01ee360020236931d.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029203000 +0000" stop="20261029210000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">End-of-Terminus Exams; Girls&apos; Talk</sub-title><desc lang="en">Iruma and the rest of the Misfit Class try to avoid failing and having to take supplementary classes; Clara drags Ameri off to meet with Elizabetta and Keroli for some girls&apos; time; they start talking about relationships and things start heating up.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20210626</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.10.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E11</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/e875cdbf0ac15d2dbf706a6ee55ffe72.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029210000 +0000" stop="20261029213000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Kalego-sensei&apos;s Home Visit</sub-title><desc lang="en">On Sullivan&apos;s orders, Kalego must visit all the homes of the Misfit Class, and he tries to get it over with as soon as possible.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20210703</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.11.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E12</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/405e88c5e00dcce36410049ae01ce6c3.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029213000 +0000" stop="20261029220000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Walter Park</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Misfit Class finally gets to go to Walter Park on their vacation; Kalego, Balam, and Opera go as their bodyguards and chaperones while Ameri thinks Iruma is asking her on a date and also joins in.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20210710</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.12.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E13</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/e6ce4c63366649c5933bd7c39c71df33.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029220000 +0000" stop="20261029223000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Everyone&apos;s Playmates</sub-title><desc lang="en">At Walter Park, Clara and Opera&apos;s team have fun trying on cute clothes; Jazz and Kalego&apos;s team try their hand at shooting games; Iruma and Balam&apos;s team is joined by Ronove but Iruma ends up getting lost going down a shady-looking alley.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20240128</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.13.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E14</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/6f76bff5051e27b93f97c852d1e0593f.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029223000 +0000" stop="20261029230000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">Magical Beasts Attack</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Walter Park staff that Iruma and his friends encounter are actually the terrorist group, the Six Fingers, who planned to destroy the park; the Six Fingers set three giant magical beasts loose on the park.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20240128</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.14.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E15</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/f634b82514fe12ba3d1e6cd5497cdf32.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029230000 +0000" stop="20261029233000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">The Name of This Feeling</sub-title><desc lang="en">The gang fights three giant magical beasts that appear in Walter Park; Opera and Ameri fight a giant rat while Jazz and his group struggle against a giant bull.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20210925</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.15.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E16</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/33963c0a926b64491ae39896069713c0.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261029233000 +0000" stop="20261030000000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">The Ultimate Halberd</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Balam team is trying to get to safety after saving some kids who weren&apos;t able to escape on their own in time; Asmodeus and Sabnock decide to fight the carmine dragon without telling anyone else.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20211002</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.16.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E17</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/d74ff57c825ab24f5f0a36c257d0f284.jpeg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261030000000 +0000" stop="20261030003000 +0000" channel="Crunchyroll 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">Welcome to Demon School! Iruma-kun</title><sub-title lang="en">My Desire</sub-title><desc lang="en">The three giant magical beasts combine to form an even bigger magical beast; Ronove uses his Charisma in order to draw the beasts&apos; attack into a different direction.</desc><credits><director>Makoto Moriwaki</director><actor>Billy Kametz</actor><actor>Laura Stahl</actor><actor>Kayli Mills</actor></credits><date>20240204</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">1.17.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S02E18</episode-num><rating><value>US_MPAA_UR</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/77d6235f5042cdaf3f86f9781b7332db.jpeg"/></programme>
