<programme start="20261028194800 +0000" stop="20261028201700 +0000" channel="JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure"><title lang="es">JoJo&apos;s Bizarre Adventure</title><sub-title lang="es">Muerte Agradecida (Segunda parte)</sub-title><desc lang="es">Conmovido por la determinación del moribundo Prosciutto de mantener activado su Stand Thankful Death, Pesci decide enfrentarse a Bucciarati.</desc><credits><actor>Kensho Ono</actor><actor>Yuichi Nakamura</actor><actor>Junichi Suwabe</actor><actor>Kohsuke Toriumi</actor><actor>Daiki Yamashita</actor><actor>Junya Enoki</actor></credits><date>20190126</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Series</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">3.15.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S04E16</episode-num><rating><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/65bd42b9b65b870013b0bd02/tile_1769467681643.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
<programme start="20261028201700 +0000" stop="20261028204600 +0000" channel="JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure"><title lang="es">JoJo&apos;s Bizarre Adventure</title><sub-title lang="es">Cabecita</sub-title><desc lang="es">Melone utiliza el cuerpo de una joven inocente para engendrar un Stand que envía a la caza de Trish, quien muestra signos de ser ella misma una usuaria de Stand.</desc><credits><actor>Kensho Ono</actor><actor>Yuichi Nakamura</actor><actor>Junichi Suwabe</actor><actor>Kohsuke Toriumi</actor><actor>Daiki Yamashita</actor><actor>Junya Enoki</actor></credits><date>20190202</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Series</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">3.16.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S04E17</episode-num><rating><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/65bd42b9b65b870013b0bd02/tile_1769467681643.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
<programme start="20261028204600 +0000" stop="20261028211500 +0000" channel="JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure"><title lang="es">JoJo&apos;s Bizarre Adventure</title><sub-title lang="es">¡Dirigíos a Venecia!</sub-title><desc lang="es">Mientras Babyhead intenta hacerlo pedazos mediante la manipulación de la materia, Giorno utiliza los poderes generadores de vida de Golden Wind y contraataca.</desc><credits><actor>Kensho Ono</actor><actor>Yuichi Nakamura</actor><actor>Junichi Suwabe</actor><actor>Kohsuke Toriumi</actor><actor>Daiki Yamashita</actor><actor>Junya Enoki</actor></credits><date>20190209</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Series</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">3.17.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S04E18</episode-num><rating><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/65bd42b9b65b870013b0bd02/tile_1769467681643.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
<programme start="20261028211500 +0000" stop="20261028214400 +0000" channel="JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure"><title lang="es">JoJo&apos;s Bizarre Adventure</title><sub-title lang="es">Hielo blanco</sub-title><desc lang="es">Giorno y Mista llegan a Venecia para recuperar el disco de datos, pero el Stand White Ice de Ghiaccio frustra su misión congelando todo lo que tienen a la vista.</desc><credits><actor>Kensho Ono</actor><actor>Yuichi Nakamura</actor><actor>Junichi Suwabe</actor><actor>Kohsuke Toriumi</actor><actor>Daiki Yamashita</actor><actor>Junya Enoki</actor><actor>Ray Chase</actor><actor>Sean Chiplock</actor><actor>Kellen Goff</actor><actor>Katsuyuki Konishi</actor></credits><date>20190215</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Series</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">3.18.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S04E19</episode-num><rating><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/65bd42b9b65b870013b0bd02/tile_1769467681643.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
<programme start="20261028214400 +0000" stop="20261028221300 +0000" channel="JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure"><title lang="es">JoJo&apos;s Bizarre Adventure</title><sub-title lang="es">La última misión del jefe</sub-title><desc lang="es">Bucciarati escolta a Trish hasta el campanario para entregarla finalmente a su padre, pero una devastadora traición pone en peligro la vida de ambos.</desc><credits><actor>Kensho Ono</actor><actor>Yuichi Nakamura</actor><actor>Junichi Suwabe</actor><actor>Kohsuke Toriumi</actor><actor>Daiki Yamashita</actor><actor>Junya Enoki</actor></credits><date>20190223</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Series</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">3.19.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S04E20</episode-num><rating><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/65bd42b9b65b870013b0bd02/tile_1769467681643.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
<programme start="20261028221300 +0000" stop="20261028224200 +0000" channel="JoJo’s Bizarre Adventure"><title lang="es">JoJo&apos;s Bizarre Adventure</title><sub-title lang="es">El misterio de Emperor Crimson</sub-title><desc lang="es">Al darse cuenta de que le habían engañado, Bucciarati decide derrotar a su jefe traidor y salvar a Trish, pero Emperor Crimson sigue llevando las de ganar.</desc><credits><actor>Kensho Ono</actor><actor>Yuichi Nakamura</actor><actor>Junichi Suwabe</actor><actor>Kohsuke Toriumi</actor><actor>Daiki Yamashita</actor><actor>Junya Enoki</actor></credits><date>20190302</date><category lang="es">Anime</category><category lang="es">Anime Series</category><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">3.20.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S04E21</episode-num><rating><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://images.pluto.tv/series/65bd42b9b65b870013b0bd02/tile_1769467681643.jpg?fill=blur&amp;fit=fill&amp;fm=jpg&amp;h=660&amp;q=75&amp;w=660"/></programme>
