<programme start="20261028180000 +0000" stop="20261028190000 +0000" channel="Todo Drama"><title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</title><sub-title lang="es">El otro lado del paraíso</sub-title><desc lang="es">La mamá de Samuel le pide perdón por no aceptarlo antes como es. Liberan a Gael de la cárcel. Nadia está obsesionada con que Toña y Bruno vuelvan.</desc><credits><director>André Binder</director><actor>Bianca Bin</actor><actor>Sergio Guizé</actor><actor>Grazi Massafera</actor><actor>Rafael Cardoso</actor><actor>Marieta Severo</actor><actor>Eriberto Leão</actor><actor>Fernanda Montenegro</actor><actor>Flávio Tolezani</actor><actor>Gloria Pires</actor><actor>Nathalia Timberg</actor><actor>Juliano Cazarré</actor><actor>Lima Duarte</actor><actor>Emílio Mello</actor><actor>Emílio de Mello</actor><actor>Juca de Oliveira</actor><actor>Thiago Fragoso</actor><actor>Bárbara Paz</actor><actor>Érika Januza</actor><actor>Alejandro Claveaux</actor><actor>Caio Paduan</actor><actor>Marcello Novaes</actor><actor>Eliane Giardini</actor><actor>Arthur Aguiar</actor><actor>Mayana Neiva</actor><actor>Laura Cardoso</actor></credits><date>20191220</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">0.43.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S01E44</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-G</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/1920x1080/c0dd6615a75519209f1037be8390b01c.jpeg"/></programme>
